="ͼ8">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼc">"https://zalo.me/0375055659?text="</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ8">+</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">encodeURIComponent</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼe">message</span><span>);</span><br><br><span class="ͼe">window</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>location</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>href </span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">url</span><span>;</span><br><br><span>}</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="2024" data-end="2042">Khi khách bấm nút:</p>
<p data-start="2044" data-end="2062"><strong data-start="2044" data-end="2062">Tôi cần tư vấn</strong></p>
<p data-start="2064" data-end="2115">→ mở Zalo<br data-start="2073" data-end="2076">
→ tin nhắn đã có sẵn toàn bộ thông tin.</p>
<hr data-start="2117" data-end="2120">
<h1 data-start="2122" data-end="2154">6. LadiPage có làm được không?</h1>
<p data-start="2155" data-end="2188"><strong data-start="2155" data-end="2165">Có thể</strong>, vì LadiPage cho phép:</p>
<ul data-start="2190" data-end="2232">
<li data-start="2190" data-end="2201">
<p data-start="2192" data-end="2201">JS custom</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2202" data-end="2217">
<p data-start="2204" data-end="2217">button action</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2218" data-end="2232">
<p data-start="2220" data-end="2232">redirect URL</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="2234" data-end="2251">Cách phổ biến là:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="2253" data-end="2313"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>Form submit</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Trigger JS</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Build Zalo URL</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Redirect</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="2315" data-end="2318">
<h1 data-start="2320" data-end="2341">7. Lưu ý quan trọng</h1>
<p data-start="2342" data-end="2366">Zalo <strong data-start="2347" data-end="2366">không cho phép:</strong></p>
<p data-start="2368" data-end="2432">❌ tự gửi tin nhắn<br data-start="2385" data-end="2388">
❌ gửi background message<br data-start="2412" data-end="2415">
❌ bot gửi từ link</p>
<p data-start="2434" data-end="2461">Khách <strong data-start="2440" data-end="2460">bắt buộc bấm Gửi</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="2463" data-end="2490">Đây là quy định chống spam.</p>
<hr data-start="2492" data-end="2495">
<h1 data-start="2497" data-end="2551">8. Cách làm thông minh hơn (rất nhiều marketer dùng)</h1>
<p data-start="2552" data-end="2601">Thay vì gửi toàn bộ form, chỉ gửi <strong data-start="2586" data-end="2600">ID booking</strong>:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="2603" data-end="2644"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>Tôi vừa đặt lịch villa</span><br><span>Mã: VH2581</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="2646" data-end="2676">Sau đó bạn tra trong hệ thống.</p>
<p data-start="2678" data-end="2686">Ưu điểm:</p>
<ul data-start="2688" data-end="2744">
<li data-start="2688" data-end="2699">
<p data-start="2690" data-end="2699">link ngắn</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2700" data-end="2712">
<p data-start="2702" data-end="2712">dễ quản lý</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2713" data-end="2744">
<p data-start="2715" data-end="2744">khách không thấy dữ liệu dài.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="2746" data-end="2749">
<p data-start="2751" data-end="2869">💡 Vì bạn đang làm <strong data-start="2770" data-end="2802">booking villa + landing page</strong>, tôi có thể chỉ thêm một cách <strong data-start="2833" data-end="2845">rất mạnh</strong> mà nhiều homestay dùng:</p>
<p data-start="2871" data-end="2941"><strong data-start="2871" data-end="2941">Form → tự tạo mã booking → mở Zalo → gửi mã đó → CRM tự nhận khách</strong></p>
<p data-start="2943" data-end="2957">Cách này giúp:</p>
<ul data-start="2958" data-end="3038" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">
<li data-start="2958" data-end="2976">
<p data-start="2960" data-end="2976">không mất lead</p>
</li>
<li data-start="2977" data-end="3004">
<p data-start="2979" data-end="3004">quản lý booking tự động</p>
</li>
<li data-start="3005" data-end="3038" data-is-last-node="">
<p data-start="3007" data-end="3038" data-is-last-node="">tỷ lệ khách chat tăng rất mạnh.</p>
</li>
</ul></div></div></div></div><div class="z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start"><div class="touch:-me-2 touch:-ms-3.5 -ms-2.5 -me-1 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-y-4 p-1 select-none touch:w-[calc(100%+--spacing(3.5))] -mt-1 w-[calc(100%+--spacing(2.5))] duration-[1.5s] focus-within:transition-none hover:transition-none touch:pointer-events-auto pointer-events-none [mask-image:linear-gradient(to_right,black_33%,transparent_66%)] [mask-size:300%_100%] [mask-position:100%_0%] motion-safe:transition-[mask-position] group-hover/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-hover/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] group-focus-within/turn-messages:pointer-events-auto group-focus-within/turn-messages:[mask-position:0_0] has-data-[state=open]:pointer-events-auto has-data-[state=open]:[mask-position:0_0]" style="mask-position: 0% 0%;"><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Copy" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="copy-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Good response" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="good-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#51753c" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></span></button><button class="text-token-text-secondary hover:bg-token-bg-secondary rounded-lg" aria-label="Bad response" aria-pressed="false" data-testid="bad-response-turn-action-button" data-state="closed"><span class="flex items-center justify-center touch:w-10 h-8 w-8"><svg