<p data-start="172" data-end="270">Dưới đây là cách đơn giản nhất, dùng <strong data-start="209" data-end="223">JavaScript</strong> trên landing page (LadiPage cũng cho chèn JS).</p>
<hr data-start="272" data-end="275">
<h1 data-start="277" data-end="291">1. Nguyên lý</h1>
<p data-start="292" data-end="347">Link của <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Zalo</span></span> có dạng:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="349" data-end="397"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>https://zalo.me/SODIENTHOAI?text=NOIDUNG</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="399" data-end="495">Nếu <strong data-start="403" data-end="414">NOIDUNG</strong> được tạo từ dữ liệu form thì khi mở Zalo, nội dung sẽ chứa luôn thông tin khách.</p>
<hr data-start="497" data-end="500">
<h1 data-start="502" data-end="517">2. Ví dụ form</h1>
<p data-start="518" data-end="544">Giả sử form có các trường:</p>
<ul data-start="546" data-end="587">
<li data-start="546" data-end="554">
<p data-start="548" data-end="554">name</p>
</li>
<li data-start="555" data-end="564">
<p data-start="557" data-end="564">phone</p>
</li>
<li data-start="565" data-end="576">
<p data-start="567" data-end="576">checkin</p>
</li>
<li data-start="577" data-end="587">
<p data-start="579" data-end="587">guests</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="589" data-end="629">Nút cuối form: <strong data-start="604" data-end="629">“Tôi cần tư vấn Zalo”</strong></p>
<hr data-start="631" data-end="634">
<h1 data-start="636" data-end="649">3. Code mẫu</h1>
