"cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span class="ͼg">&lt;button</span><span> </span><span class="ͼf">type</span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span class="ͼc">"button"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼf">onclick</span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span class="ͼc">"</span><span class="ͼe">sendToZalo</span><span>()</span><span class="ͼc">"</span><span class="ͼg">&gt;</span><span>Tôi cần tư vấn qua Zalo</span><span class="ͼg">&lt;/button&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼg">&lt;script&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼ8">function</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">sendToZalo</span><span>(){</span><br><br><span class="ͼ8">let</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">name</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">document</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>querySelector(</span><span class="ͼc">"#name"</span><span>)</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>value;</span><br><span class="ͼ8">let</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">phone</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">document</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>querySelector(</span><span class="ͼc">"#phone"</span><span>)</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>value;</span><br><span class="ͼ8">let</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">checkin</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">document</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>querySelector(</span><span class="ͼc">"#checkin"</span><span>)</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>value;</span><br><span class="ͼ8">let</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">guests</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">document</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>querySelector(</span><span class="ͼc">"#guests"</span><span>)</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>value;</span><br><br><span class="ͼ8">let</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">message</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><br><span class="ͼc">`Khách vừa điền form villa:</span><br><span class="ͼc">Tên: </span><span>${</span><span class="ͼe">name</span><span>}</span><br><span class="ͼc">SĐT: </span><span>${</span><span class="ͼe">phone</span><span>}</span><br><span class="ͼc">Checkin: </span><span>${</span><span class="ͼe">checkin</span><span>}</span><br><span class="ͼc">Số khách: </span><span>${</span><span class="ͼe">guests</span><span>}</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">Tôi cần tư vấn thêm`</span><span>;</span><br><br><span class="ͼ8">let</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">zaloURL</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span> </span><span class="ͼc">"https://zalo.me/0375055659?text="</span><span> </span><span class="ͼ8">+</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">encodeURIComponent</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼe">message</span><span>);</span><br><br><span class="ͼe">window</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>open(</span><span class="ͼe">zaloURL</span><span>, </span><span class="ͼc">"_blank"</span><span>);</span><br><br><span>}</span><br><span class="ͼg">&lt;/script&gt;</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div><div class="flex w-full justify-end px-3 mt-1" data-code-block-feedback-row="true"></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1247" data-end="1250">
<h1 data-start="1252" data-end="1282">4. Kết quả khi khách bấm nút</h1>
<p data-start="1283" data-end="1320">Zalo sẽ mở ra với tin nhắn đã có sẵn:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1322" data-end="1439"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>Khách vừa điền form villa:</span><br><span>Tên: Nguyễn Văn A</span><br><span>SĐT: 0988888888</span><br><span>Checkin: 25/03</span><br><span>Số khách: 10</span><br><br><span>Tôi cần tư vấn thêm</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1441" data-end="1467">Khách chỉ cần <strong data-start="1455" data-end="1466">bấm Gửi</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="1469" data-end="1472">
<h1 data-start="1474" data-end="1499">5. Ưu điểm của cách này</h1>
<p data-start="1500" data-end="1629">✔ không cần CRM<br data-start="1515" data-end="1518">
✔ không cần server<br data-start="1536" data-end="1539">
✔ hoạt động ngay trên landing page<br data-start="1573" data-end="1576">
✔ bạn nhận được <strong data-start="1592" data-end="1629">đầy đủ thông tin khách trong Zalo</strong></p>
<hr data-start="1631" data-end="1634">
<h1 data-start="1636" data-end="1668">6. Mẹo để tăng tỷ lệ khách gửi</h1>
<p data-start="1669" data-end="1681">Nút nên ghi:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1683" data-end="1717"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>Nhận tư vấn nhanh qua Zalo</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
