px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div tabindex="-1" class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="cbf2fc35-72e0-4c1d-9908-1667ac969016" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-3" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="203">Nếu bạn đặt <strong data-start="12" data-end="63">form trên <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Google Sites</span></span></strong>, thì thực chất form đó thường là <strong data-start="97" data-end="159"><span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Google Forms</span></span> được nhúng vào trang</strong>. Vì vậy cách xử lý sẽ dựa vào Google Forms.</p>
<p data-start="205" data-end="408">Tuy nhiên cần biết <strong data-start="224" data-end="251">một giới hạn quan trọng</strong>:<br data-start="252" data-end="255">
➡️ Google Forms <strong data-start="271" data-end="364">không cho chạy JavaScript và không cho lấy dữ liệu form ngay trong trang để tạo link động</strong>.<br data-start="365" data-end="368">
Vì vậy ta phải dùng <strong data-start="388" data-end="407">cách trung gian</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="410" data-end="446">Dưới đây là <strong data-start="422" data-end="445">2 cách khả thi nhất</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="448" data-end="451">
<h1 data-start="453" data-end="488">Cách 1 — Dễ nhất (không cần code)</h1>
<h2 data-start="489" data-end="500">Bước 1</h2>
<p data-start="501" data-end="549">Trong Google Forms → <strong data-start="522" data-end="549">Settings → Presentation</strong></p>
<p data-start="551" data-end="582">Chỉnh <strong data-start="557" data-end="581">Confirmation message</strong>:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="584" data-end="718"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>Cảm ơn bạn đã gửi thông tin.</span><br><br><span>Để được tư vấn nhanh hơn hãy nhắn Zalo cho chúng tôi tại:</span><br><span>https://zalo.me/0342975298</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="720" data-end="766">Khách submit form → thấy link → bấm → mở Zalo.</p>
<h3 data-start="768" data-end="779">Ưu điểm</h3>
<p data-start="780" data-end="817">✔ rất dễ làm<br data-start="792" data-end="795">
✔ không cần kỹ thuật</p>
<h3 data-start="819" data-end="833">Nhược điểm</h3>
<p data-start="834" data-end="877">Tin nhắn <strong data-start="843" data-end="876">không tự chứa thông tin khách</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="879" data-end="882">
<h1 data-start="884" data-end="925">Cách 2 — Cách tốt hơn (dùng mã booking)</h1>
<p data-start="926" data-end="962">Cách này nhiều homestay và spa dùng.</p>
<h2 data-start="964" data-end="981">Flow hoạt động</h2>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="983" data-end="1157"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>Khách điền Google Form</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Data lưu vào Google Sheets</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Google Sheets tạo mã booking</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Khách bấm link Zalo</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Nhắn mã booking cho bạn</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Bạn tra Google Sheets</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1159" data-end="1162">
<h2 data-start="1164" data-end="1201">Bước 1: Form lưu vào Google Sheets</h2>
<p data-start="1202" data-end="1247">Google Forms → Responses → <strong data-start="1229" data-end="1247">Link to Sheets</strong></p>
<p data-start="1249" data-end="1275">Dữ liệu sẽ thành bảng như:</p>
<div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div tabindex="-1" class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit"><table data-start="1277" data-end="1345" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="1277" data-end="1323"><tr data-start="1277" data-end="1323"><th data-start="1277" data-end="1289" data-col-size="sm" class="">Timestamp</th><th data-start="1289" data-end="1295" data-col-size="sm" class="">Tên</th><th data-start="1295" data-end="1301" data-col-size="sm" class="">SĐT</th><th data-start="1301" data-end="1311" data-col-size="sm" class="">Checkin</th><th data-start="1311" data-end="1323" data-col-size="sm" class="">Số khách</th></tr></thead></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 32.7188px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copy table" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
<hr data-start="1347" data-end="1350">
<h2 data-start="1352" data-end="1377">Bước 2: tạo mã booking</h2>
<p data-start="1378" data-end="1435">Trong <strong data-start="1384" data-end="1425"><span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Google Sheets</span></span></strong> thêm cột:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1437" data-end="1467"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>Booking ID</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1469" data-end="1479">Công thức:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1481" data-end="1526"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>="VH"&amp;TEXT(ROW(A2),"000")</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1528" data-end="1536">Kết quả:</p>
