<p data-start="194" data-end="232">Tôi sẽ hướng dẫn <strong data-start="211" data-end="231">từng bước cụ thể</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="234" data-end="237">
<h1 data-start="239" data-end="272">Bước 1: Tạo form trong LadiPage</h1>
<p data-start="273" data-end="321">Trong LadiPage bạn tạo form gồm các field ví dụ:</p>
<ul data-start="323" data-end="420">
<li data-start="323" data-end="339">
<p data-start="325" data-end="339">Tên → <strong data-start="331" data-end="339">name</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="340" data-end="367">
<p data-start="342" data-end="367">Số điện thoại → <strong data-start="358" data-end="367">phone</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="368" data-end="396">
<p data-start="370" data-end="396">Ngày checkin → <strong data-start="385" data-end="396">checkin</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="397" data-end="420">
<p data-start="399" data-end="420">Số khách → <strong data-start="410" data-end="420">guests</strong></p>
</li>
