<p data-start="189" data-end="295">Tôi sẽ giải thích <strong data-start="207" data-end="294">cách hoạt động + cách setup đơn giản nhất với <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">LadiPage</span></span></strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="297" data-end="300">
<h1 data-start="302" data-end="336">1. Tại sao cách này hiệu quả hơn</h1>
<p data-start="337" data-end="363">Nếu bạn để link trực tiếp:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="365" data-end="390"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>TikTok bio → Zalo</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="392" data-end="405">Khách thường:</p>
<ul data-start="407" data-end="443">
<li data-start="407" data-end="416">
<p data-start="409" data-end="416">bấm vào</p>
</li>
<li data-start="417" data-end="422">
<p data-start="419" data-end="422">xem</p>
</li>
<li data-start="423" data-end="443">
<p data-start="425" data-end="443"><strong data-start="425" data-end="443">không nhắn tin</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="445" data-end="476">Tỉ lệ nhắn thường chỉ <strong data-start="467" data-end="475">2–5%</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="478" data-end="481">
<p data-start="483" data-end="499">Khi dùng funnel:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="501" data-end="573"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>TikTok</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>landing page</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>form nhanh</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>mở Zalo với thông tin khách</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="575" data-end="653">Khách đã <strong data-start="584" data-end="606">điền thông tin rồi</strong> nên khi Zalo mở ra họ thường <strong data-start="636" data-end="652">bấm gửi luôn</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="655" data-end="684">Tỉ lệ nhắn có thể <strong data-start="673" data-end="683">10–20%</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="686" data-end="689">
<h1 data-start="691" data-end="710">2. Flow hoạt động</h1>
<p data-start="711" data-end="728">Toàn bộ hệ thống:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="730" data-end="840"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>TikTok video</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Link bio</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Landing page</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Form 10 giây</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Button mở Zalo</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Tin nhắn chứa thông tin khách</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="842" data-end="857">Ví dụ tin nhắn:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="859" data-end="946"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>Khách cần tư vấn villa</span><br><br><span>Tên: Minh Anh</span><br><span>SĐT: 098888888</span><br><span>Checkin: 25/04</span><br><span>Số khách: 8</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="948" data-end="951">
<h1 data-start="953" data-end="985">3. Cấu trúc landing page chuẩn</h1>
<p data-start="986" data-end="1026">Trang landing page chỉ cần <strong data-start="1013" data-end="1025">rất ngắn</strong>:</p>
<h3 data-start="1028" data-end="1041">Section 1</h3>
<p data-start="1042" data-end="1050">Tiêu đề:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1052" data-end="1094"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>Kiểm tra villa còn trống cuối tuần</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1096" data-end="1104">Subtext:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1106" data-end="1158"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>Điền thông tin để được tư vấn nhanh qua Zalo</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="1160" data-end="1163">
<h3 data-start="1165" data-end="1191">Section 2 – Form nhanh</h3>
<p data-start="1192" data-end="1223">Form chỉ nên có <strong data-start="1208" data-end="1222">3–4 trường</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="1225" data-end="1268">
<li data-start="1225" data-end="1232">
<p data-start="1227" data-end="1232">Tên</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1233" data-end="1240">
<p data-start="1235" data-end="1240">SĐT</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1241" data-end="1257">
<p data-start="1243" data-end="1257">Ngày checkin</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1258" data-end="1268">
<p data-start="1260" data-end="1268">Số khách</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1270" data-end="1293">Điền trong <strong data-start="1281" data-end="1292">10 giây</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="1295" data-end="1298">
