<h2 data-start="61" data-end="127">1️⃣ Khả năng chịu tải của <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Linktree</span></span></h2>
<ul data-start="128" data-end="588">
<li data-start="128" data-end="228">
<p data-start="130" data-end="228">Nền tảng này phục vụ <strong data-start="151" data-end="178">hơn 70 triệu người dùng</strong> toàn cầu. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 56px;"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Linktree?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Linktree?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" style="max-width: 56px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Wikipedia</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="229" data-end="320">
<p data-start="231" data-end="320">Lưu lượng <strong data-start="241" data-end="279">hơn 1.2 tỷ lượt truy cập mỗi tháng</strong>. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 91px;"><a href="https://rohan-singhs-blog.typeflo.io/posts/linktree-teardown-link-in-bio-pioneer-scales-beyond-70m-users?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://rohan-singhs-blog.typeflo.io/posts/linktree-teardown-link-in-bio-pioneer-scales-beyond-70m-users?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" style="max-width: 91px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Slay 101 - Blog</span><span class="-me-1 flex h-full items-center rounded-full px-1 text-[#8F8F8F]">+1</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="321" data-end="437">
<p data-start="323" data-end="437">Hạ tầng dùng <strong data-start="336" data-end="366">CDN và edge cloud (Fastly)</strong> với uptime khoảng <strong data-start="385" data-end="396">99.999%</strong>. <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 43px;"><a href="https://itwire.com/business-it-sp-511/business-it/linktree-deploys-fastly%E2%80%99s-edge-cloud-platform-and-cloud-based-web-application.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://itwire.com/business-it-sp-511/business-it/linktree-deploys-fastly%E2%80%99s-edge-cloud-platform-and-cloud-based-web-application.html?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" style="max-width: 43px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">iTWire</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="438" data-end="588">
<p data-start="440" data-end="588">Hệ thống được thiết kế để <strong data-start="466" data-end="515">chịu các traffic spike lớn từ người nổi tiếng</strong> (ví dụ khi celebrity đăng link). <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 39px;"><a href="https://www.fastly.com/press/press-releases/fastlys-edge-cloud-platform-delivers-and-secures-link-in-bio-for-linktrees?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://www.fastly.com/press/press-releases/fastlys-edge-cloud-platform-delivers-and-secures-link-in-bio-for-linktrees?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" style="max-width: 39px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Fastly</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="590" data-end="686">👉 Vì vậy việc <strong data-start="605" data-end="640">100.000 người truy cập cùng lúc</strong> với một trang Linktree <strong data-start="664" data-end="685">không phải vấn đề</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="688" data-end="696">Thực tế:</p>
<ul data-start="698" data-end="831">
<li data-start="698" data-end="741">
<p data-start="700" data-end="741">Các tài khoản lớn trên TikTok / Instagram</p>
</li>
<li data-start="742" data-end="831">
<p data-start="744" data-end="831">Khi video viral vài triệu view<br data-start="774" data-end="777">
→ có thể đẩy <strong data-start="790" data-end="830">hàng trăm nghìn click trong vài phút</strong>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="833" data-end="836">
<h2 data-start="838" data-end="904">2️⃣ Khả năng chịu tải của <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Beacons</span></span></h2>
<p data-start="905" data-end="969">Beacons cũng chạy trên <strong data-start="928" data-end="964">cloud infrastructure (AWS + CDN)</strong> nên:</p>
<ul data-start="971" data-end="1027">
<li data-start="971" data-end="989">
<p data-start="973" data-end="989">chịu traffic lớn</p>
</li>
<li data-start="990" data-end="1027">
<p data-start="992" data-end="1027">auto scale khi lượng truy cập tăng.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1029" data-end="1039">Tuy nhiên:</p>
<ul data-start="1040" data-end="1119">
<li data-start="1040" data-end="1076">
<p data-start="1042" data-end="1076">quy mô người dùng nhỏ hơn Linktree</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1077" data-end="1119">
<p data-start="1079" data-end="1119">ít dữ liệu công khai về traffic cực lớn.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1121" data-end="1196">👉 Nếu xét <strong data-start="1132" data-end="1156">độ ổn định khi viral</strong>, Linktree thường được đánh giá cao hơn.</p>
<hr data-start="1198" data-end="1201">
<h2 data-start="1203" data-end="1245">3️⃣ Điều bạn cần lo KHÔNG phải Linktree</h2>
<p data-start="1246" data-end="1267">Điểm nghẽn thường là:</p>
<p data-start="1269" data-end="1289">1️⃣ <strong data-start="1273" data-end="1289">Zalo của bạn</strong></p>
<p data-start="1291" data-end="1297">Ví dụ:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1299" data-end="1369"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>100k người click</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>10k người nhắn Zalo</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Bạn không trả lời kịp</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1371" data-end="1392">2️⃣ <strong data-start="1375" data-end="1392">Form hoặc CRM</strong></p>
<p data-start="1394" data-end="1400">Ví dụ:</p>
<ul data-start="1402" data-end="1463">
<li data-start="1402" data-end="1428">
<p data-start="1404" data-end="1428">Google Form chịu tải tốt</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1429" data-end="1463">
<p data-start="1431" data-end="1463">nhưng xử lý lead cần automation.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1465" data-end="1468">
<h2 data-start="1470" data-end="1514">4️⃣ Setup tốt nhất cho TikTok traffic lớn</h2>
<p data-start="1515" data-end="1534">Funnel thường dùng:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1536" data-end="1621"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>TikTok video</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Linktree</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>2 nút chính</span><br><span>   - Chat Zalo</span><br><span>   - Kiểm tra lịch villa</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1623" data-end="1631">Ưu điểm:</p>
<ul data-start="1633" data-end="1687">
<li data-start="1633" data-end="1651">
<p data-start="1635" data-end="1651">chịu traffic lớn</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1652" data-end="1666">
<p data-start="1654" data-end="1666">dễ thay link</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1667" data-end="1687">
<p data-start="1669" data-end="1687">có thống kê click.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1689" data-end="1692">
<p data-start="1694" data-end="1819">💡 Nếu bạn đang chạy <strong data-start="1715" data-end="1740">TikTok villa/homestay</strong>, tôi có thể chỉ thêm <strong data-start="1762" data-end="1818">1 cấu trúc link bio đang được nhiều bên booking dùng</strong>:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1821" data-end="1893"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>TikTok</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>link bio</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>trang mini</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>nút Zalo tự điền nội dung khách</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
