<ul data-start="26" data-end="118">
<li data-start="26" data-end="40">
<p data-start="28" data-end="40"><strong data-start="28" data-end="40">Miễn phí</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="41" data-end="78">
<p data-start="43" data-end="78"><strong data-start="43" data-end="78">chịu được traffic lớn từ TikTok</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="79" data-end="118">
<p data-start="81" data-end="118"><strong data-start="81" data-end="118">không giới hạn visitor hàng tháng</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="120" data-end="203">thì trong các “trang mini” (link bio tools) phổ biến, đây là các lựa chọn tốt nhất.</p>
<hr data-start="205" data-end="208">
<h1 data-start="210" data-end="254">1️⃣ Tốt nhất (miễn phí + chịu traffic lớn)</h1>
<h3 data-start="255" data-end="296"><span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Linktree</span></span></h3>
<p data-start="298" data-end="309"><strong data-start="298" data-end="309">Ưu điểm</strong></p>
<ul data-start="311" data-end="581">
<li data-start="311" data-end="378">
<p data-start="313" data-end="378">có gói <strong data-start="320" data-end="338">Free vĩnh viễn</strong> <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 49px;"><a href="https://linktr.ee/s/pricing?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://linktr.ee/s/pricing?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" style="max-width: 49px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Linktree</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
