<p data-start="381" data-end="462"><strong data-start="381" data-end="407">không giới hạn số link</strong> trên trang bio <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 49px;"><a href="https://linktr.ee/pricing?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://linktr.ee/pricing?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" style="max-width: 49px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">Linktree</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="463" data-end="546">
<p data-start="465" data-end="546">có <strong data-start="468" data-end="488">analytics cơ bản</strong> (lượt xem, click) <span class="" data-state="closed"><span class="ms-1 inline-flex max-w-full items-center select-none relative top-[-0.094rem] animate-[show_150ms_ease-in]" data-testid="webpage-citation-pill" style="width: 53px;"><a href="https://getlinkshop.com/blog/does-linktree-show-who-clicks?utm_source=chatgpt.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" alt="https://getlinkshop.com/blog/does-linktree-show-who-clicks?utm_source=chatgpt.com" class="flex h-4.5 overflow-hidden rounded-xl px-2 text-[9px] font-medium transition-colors duration-150 ease-in-out text-token-text-secondary! bg-[#F4F4F4]! dark:bg-[#303030]!" style="max-width: 53px;"><span class="relative start-0 bottom-0 flex h-full w-full items-center"><span class="flex h-4 w-full items-center justify-between overflow-hidden" style="opacity: 1; transform: none;"><span class="max-w-[15ch] grow truncate overflow-hidden text-center">LinkShop</span></span></span></a></span></span></p>
</li>
<li data-start="547" data-end="581">
<p data-start="549" data-end="581">hạ tầng lớn → chịu traffic viral</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="583" data-end="674">👉 Hàng triệu creator đang dùng, nên <strong data-start="620" data-end="673">100k – 1 triệu visitor/tháng vẫn chạy bình thường</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="676" data-end="712"><strong data-start="676" data-end="712">Phù hợp nhất cho TikTok traffic.</strong></p>
<hr data-start="714" data-end="717">
<h1 data-start="719" data-end="762">2️⃣ Cũng miễn phí (nhưng ít phổ biến hơn)</h1>
<h3 data-start="763" data-end="804"><span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Beacons</span></span></h3>
<p data-start="806" data-end="814">Ưu điểm:</p>
<ul data-start="816" data-end="877">
<li data-start="816" data-end="834">
<p data-start="818" data-end="834">có <strong data-start="821" data-end="834">free plan</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="835" data-end="858">
<p data-start="837" data-end="858">có <strong data-start="840" data-end="858">form thu khách</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="859" data-end="877">
<p data-start="861" data-end="877">có <strong data-start="864" data-end="877">analytics</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="879" data-end="890">Nhược điểm:</p>
<ul data-start="892" data-end="965">
<li data-start="892" data-end="923">
<p data-start="894" data-end="923">hệ sinh thái nhỏ hơn Linktree</p>
</li>
<li data-start="924" data-end="965">
<p data-start="926" data-end="965">đôi khi tải chậm hơn ở một số quốc gia.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="967" data-end="970">
<h1 data-start="972" data-end="1015">3️⃣ Miễn phí 100% và chịu traffic rất lớn</h1>
<h3 data-start="1016" data-end="1057"><span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Google Sites</span></span></h3>
<p data-start="1059" data-end="1067">Ưu điểm:</p>
<ul data-start="1069" data-end="1165">
<li data-start="1069" data-end="1079">
<p data-start="1071" data-end="1079">miễn phí</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1080" data-end="1119">
<p data-start="1082" data-end="1119">hạ tầng Google → chịu traffic cực lớn</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1120" data-end="1165">
<p data-start="1122" data-end="1165">có thể tạo <strong data-start="1133" data-end="1165">trang mini + form + nút Zalo</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1167" data-end="1178">Nhược điểm:</p>
<ul data-start="1180" data-end="1216">
<li data-start="1180" data-end="1216">
<p data-start="1182" data-end="1216">giao diện không đẹp bằng Linktree.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1218" data-end="1221">
