<p data-start="106" data-end="135">Tôi giải thích đơn giản nhất.</p>
<hr data-start="137" data-end="140">
<h1 data-start="142" data-end="171">1️⃣ Linktree dùng để làm gì</h1>
<p data-start="172" data-end="247"><span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Linktree</span></span> là <strong data-start="213" data-end="238">trang chứa nhiều link</strong> cho bio.</p>
<p data-start="249" data-end="261">Ví dụ trang:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="263" data-end="359"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>🏡 Villa Ba Vì</span><br><br><span>📅 Kiểm tra lịch cuối tuần</span><br><span>📲 Nhắn Zalo</span><br><span>🎥 Xem video villa</span><br><span>📍 Xem bản đồ</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="361" data-end="387">Linktree chỉ làm nhiệm vụ:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="389" data-end="432"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>TikTok</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Linktree</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>khách chọn link</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="434" data-end="472">👉 <strong data-start="437" data-end="472">không thu thập thông tin khách.</strong></p>
<hr data-start="474" data-end="477">
<h1 data-start="479" data-end="508">2️⃣ Typeform dùng để làm gì</h1>
<p data-start="509" data-end="579"><span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Typeform</span></span> là <strong data-start="550" data-end="578">form hỏi thông tin khách</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="581" data-end="592">Ví dụ form:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="594" data-end="627"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>Tên</span><br><span>Ngày checkin</span><br><span>Số khách</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="629" data-end="651">Sau khi khách bấm gửi:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="653" data-end="702"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>Form</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>mở Zalo</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>tin nhắn đã có thông tin</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="704" data-end="734">👉 <strong data-start="707" data-end="733">thu được dữ liệu khách</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="736" data-end="739">
<h1 data-start="741" data-end="760">3️⃣ So sánh nhanh</h1>
<div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div tabindex="-1" class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit"><table data-start="762" data-end="935" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="762" data-end="787"><tr data-start="762" data-end="787"><th data-start="762" data-end="764" data-col-size="sm" class=""></th><th data-start="764" data-end="775" data-col-size="sm" class="">Linktree</th><th data-start="775" data-end="787" data-col-size="sm" class="">Typeform</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="802" data-end="935"><tr data-start="802" data-end="846"><td data-start="802" data-end="811" data-col-size="sm">Mục đích</td><td data-start="811" data-end="828" data-col-size="sm">Trang link bio</td><td data-start="828" data-end="846" data-col-size="sm">Form thu khách</td></tr><tr data-start="847" data-end="870"><td data-start="847" data-end="861" data-col-size="sm">Thu thông tin</td><td data-start="861" data-end="865" data-col-size="sm">❌</td><td data-start="865" data-end="870" data-col-size="sm">✅</td></tr><tr data-start="871" data-end="899"><td data-start="871" data-end="890" data-col-size="sm">Redirect sang Zalo</td><td data-start="890" data-end="894" data-col-size="sm">❌</td><td data-start="894" data-end="899" data-col-size="sm">✅</td></tr><tr data-start="900" data-end="935"><td data-start="900" data-end="912" data-col-size="sm">Độ phức tạp</td><td data-start="912" data-end="921" data-col-size="sm">rất dễ</td><td data-start="921" data-end="935" data-col-size="sm">trung bình</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 32.7188px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copy table" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/