<hr data-start="226" data-end="229">
<h1 data-start="231" data-end="258">So sánh Typeform và Tally</h1>
<div class="TyagGW_tableContainer"><div tabindex="-1" class="group TyagGW_tableWrapper flex flex-col-reverse w-fit"><table data-start="260" data-end="510" class="w-fit min-w-(--thread-content-width)"><thead data-start="260" data-end="291"><tr data-start="260" data-end="291"><th data-start="260" data-end="271" data-col-size="sm" class="">Tiêu chí</th><th data-start="271" data-end="282" data-col-size="sm" class="">Typeform</th><th data-start="282" data-end="291" data-col-size="sm" class="">Tally</th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="306" data-end="510"><tr data-start="306" data-end="330"><td data-start="306" data-end="314" data-col-size="sm">Dễ dùng</td><td data-start="314" data-end="321" data-col-size="sm">⭐⭐⭐⭐</td><td data-start="321" data-end="330" data-col-size="sm">⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td></tr><tr data-start="331" data-end="367"><td data-start="331" data-end="340" data-col-size="sm">Miễn phí</td><td data-start="340" data-end="350" data-col-size="sm">hạn chế</td><td data-start="350" data-end="367" data-col-size="sm">rất thoải mái</td></tr><tr data-start="368" data-end="401"><td data-start="368" data-end="392" data-col-size="sm">Redirect sang link khác</td><td data-start="392" data-end="396" data-col-size="sm">✅</td><td data-start="396" data-end="401" data-col-size="sm">✅</td></tr><tr data-start="402" data-end="432"><td data-start="402" data-end="423" data-col-size="sm">Chèn dữ liệu vào URL</td><td data-start="423" data-end="427" data-col-size="sm">✅</td><td data-start="427" data-end="432" data-col-size="sm">✅</td></tr><tr data-start="433" data-end="469"><td data-start="433" data-end="444" data-col-size="sm">Tốc độ tải</td><td data-start="444" data-end="456" data-col-size="sm">khá nhanh</td><td data-start="456" data-end="469" data-col-size="sm">rất nhanh</td></tr><tr data-start="470" data-end="510"><td data-start="470" data-end="493" data-col-size="sm">Phù hợp TikTok traffic</td><td data-start="493" data-end="499" data-col-size="sm">tốt</td><td data-start="499" data-end="510" data-col-size="sm">rất tốt</td></tr></tbody></table><div class="sticky h-0 select-none end-(--thread-content-margin) self-end"><div class="absolute end-0 flex items-end" style="height: 32.7188px;"><span class="" data-state="closed"><button aria-label="Copy table" class="hover:bg-token-bg-tertiary text-token-text-secondary my-1 rounded-sm p-1 transition-opacity group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:pointer-events-none group-[:not(:hover):not(:focus-within)]:opacity-0"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></span></div></div></div></div>
<hr data-start="512" data-end="515">
<h1 data-start="517" data-end="531">1️⃣ Typeform</h1>
<p data-start="532" data-end="540">Ưu điểm:</p>
<ul data-start="542" data-end="629">
<li data-start="542" data-end="582">
<p data-start="544" data-end="582">giao diện <strong data-start="554" data-end="582">rất đẹp và chuyên nghiệp</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="583" data-end="611">
<p data-start="585" data-end="611">trải nghiệm người dùng tốt</p>
</li>
<li data-start="612" data-end="629">
<p data-start="614" data-end="629">nhiều template.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="631" data-end="642">Nhược điểm:</p>
<ul data-start="644" data-end="718">
<li data-start="644" data-end="686">
<p data-start="646" data-end="686">gói free <strong data-start="655" data-end="686">giới hạn số responses/tháng</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="687" data-end="718">
<p data-start="689" data-end="718">một số tính năng cần trả phí.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="720" data-end="772">👉 Phù hợp nếu bạn muốn <strong data-start="744" data-end="771">form nhìn chuyên nghiệp</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="774" data-end="777">
<h1 data-start="779" data-end="790">2️⃣ Tally</h1>
<p data-start="791" data-end="803">Ưu điểm lớn:</p>
<ul data-start="805" data-end="930">
<li data-start="805" data-end="837">
<p data-start="807" data-end="837"><strong data-start="807" data-end="837">gần như miễn phí hoàn toàn</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="838" data-end="878">
<p data-start="840" data-end="878"><strong data-start="840" data-end="878">không giới hạn số form submissions</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="879" data-end="911">
<p data-start="881" data-end="911">có <strong data-start="884" data-end="911">redirect sau khi submit</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="912" data-end="930">
<p data-start="914" data-end="930">rất dễ tạo form.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="932" data-end="943">Nhược điểm:</p>
<ul data-start="945" data-end="970">
<li data-start="945" data-end="970">
<p data-start="947" data-end="970">giao diện đơn giản hơn.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="972" data-end="1076">👉 Nhiều người làm <strong data-start="991" data-end="1017">TikTok lead generation</strong> thích dùng Tally vì <strong data-start="1038" data-end="1075">không lo giới hạn khách điền form</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="1078" data-end="1081">
<h1 data-start="1083" data-end="1108">Ví dụ funnel dùng Tally</h1>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1110" data-end="1202"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>TikTok</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Link bio</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Tally form</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Redirect sang Zalo</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Tin nhắn đã có thông tin khách</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
