<h1 data-start="1387" data-end="1423">Khuyên dùng cho trường hợp của bạn</h1>
<p data-start="1424" data-end="1440">Nếu mục tiêu là:</p>
<ul data-start="1442" data-end="1518">
<li data-start="1442" data-end="1456">
<p data-start="1444" data-end="1456"><strong data-start="1444" data-end="1456">miễn phí</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1457" data-end="1486">
<p data-start="1459" data-end="1486"><strong data-start="1459" data-end="1486">chịu traffic TikTok lớn</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1487" data-end="1518">
<p data-start="1489" data-end="1518"><strong data-start="1489" data-end="1518">không giới hạn khách điền</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1520" data-end="1554">👉 <strong data-start="1523" data-end="1554">Tally là lựa chọn tốt nhất.</strong></p>
<hr data-start="1556" data-end="1559">
<p data-start="1561" data-end="1618">💡 Một mẹo rất quan trọng khi dùng form cho khách TikTok:</p>
<p data-start="1620" data-end="1653">Form <strong data-start="1625" data-end="1652">không nên quá 3 câu hỏi</strong>:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1655" data-end="1688"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>Tên</span><br><span>Ngày checkin</span><br><span>Số khách</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
