<h1 data-start="1265" data-end="1280">Giải pháp 3</h1>
<h2 data-start="1281" data-end="1299">Dùng automation</h2>
<p data-start="1301" data-end="1330">Form → automation → gửi Zalo.</p>
<p data-start="1332" data-end="1344">Có thể dùng:</p>
<ul data-start="1346" data-end="1429">
<li data-start="1346" data-end="1387">
