<p data-start="1390" data-end="1429"><span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Zapier</span></span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1431" data-end="1437">Nhưng:</p>
<ul data-start="1439" data-end="1466">
<li data-start="1439" data-end="1450">
<p data-start="1441" data-end="1450">cần API</p>
</li>
<li data-start="1451" data-end="1466">
<p data-start="1453" data-end="1466">khá phức tạp.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<hr data-start="1468" data-end="1471">
<h1 data-start="1473" data-end="1504">Khuyên cho trường hợp của bạn</h1>
<p data-start="1505" data-end="1521">Nếu mục tiêu là:</p>
<ul data-start="1523" data-end="1588">
<li data-start="1523" data-end="1537">
<p data-start="1525" data-end="1537"><strong data-start="1525" data-end="1537">miễn phí</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1538" data-end="1565">
<p data-start="1540" data-end="1565"><strong data-start="1540" data-end="1565">khách nhắn Zalo nhanh</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="1566" data-end="1588">
<p data-start="1568" data-end="1588"><strong data-start="1568" data-end="1588">tự điền nội dung</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="1590" data-end="1639">→ dùng <strong data-start="1597" data-end="1638">trang mini nhập trực tiếp rồi mở Zalo</strong>.</p>
