"cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span class="ͼ7">&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼg">&lt;html&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼg">&lt;head&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼg">&lt;meta</span><span> </span><span class="ͼf">charset</span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span class="ͼc">"UTF-8"</span><span class="ͼg">&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼg">&lt;title&gt;</span><span>Homestay Hà Nội</span><span class="ͼg">&lt;/title&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼg">&lt;/head&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼg">&lt;body&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼg">&lt;h2&gt;</span><span>🏡 Homestay Hà Nội</span><span class="ͼg">&lt;/h2&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼg">&lt;p&gt;</span><span>Điền nhanh thông tin để kiểm tra phòng còn trống</span><span class="ͼg">&lt;/p&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼg">&lt;input</span><span> </span><span class="ͼf">id</span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span class="ͼc">"ten"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼf">placeholder</span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span class="ͼc">"Tên của bạn"</span><span class="ͼg">&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼg">&lt;input</span><span> </span><span class="ͼf">id</span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span class="ͼc">"ngay"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼf">placeholder</span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span class="ͼc">"Ngày checkin"</span><span class="ͼg">&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</span><br><span class="ͼg">&lt;input</span><span> </span><span class="ͼf">id</span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span class="ͼc">"khach"</span><span> </span><span class="ͼf">placeholder</span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span class="ͼc">"Số khách"</span><span class="ͼg">&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼg">&lt;button</span><span> </span><span class="ͼf">onclick</span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span class="ͼc">"</span><span class="ͼe">guiZalo</span><span>()</span><span class="ͼc">"</span><span class="ͼg">&gt;</span><span>Kiểm tra phòng</span><span class="ͼg">&lt;/button&gt;</span><br><br><span class="ͼg">&lt;script&gt;</span><b