<p data-start="1634" data-end="1679">Sau khoảng <strong data-start="1645" data-end="1659">30–60 giây</strong>, trang sẽ chạy tại:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1681" data-end="1738"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>https://bdsducanh96-code.github.io/homestay-hanoi</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1740" data-end="1897">Khách từ <strong data-start="1749" data-end="1790"><span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">TikTok</span></span></strong> vào link đó → nhập thông tin → mở chat <strong data-start="1830" data-end="1871"><span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Zalo</span></span></strong> với tin nhắn đã điền sẵn.</p>
<hr data-start="1899" data-end="1902">
<p data-start="1904" data-end="1993">✅ Nếu bạn muốn, tôi có thể giúp bạn làm thêm <strong data-start="1949" data-end="1992">3 cải tiến rất quan trọng cho trang này</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="1995" data-end="2153" data-is-last-node="" data-is-only-node="">
<li data-start="1995" data-end="2043">
<p data-start="1997" data-end="2043">giao diện <strong data-start="2007" data-end="2041">đẹp và dễ dùng trên điện thoại</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="2044" data-end="2096">
<p data-start="2046" data-end="2096">thêm <strong data-start="2051" data-end="2094">icon Zalo + nút lớn để khách bấm dễ hơn</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="2097" data-end="2153" data-is-last-node="">
<p data-start="2099" data-end="2153" data-is-last-node="">tăng tỷ lệ <strong data-start="2110" data-end="2152">khách TikTok nhắn Zalo lên gấp 2–3 lần</strong>.</p>
</li>
