<ul data-start="116" data-end="394">
<li data-start="116" data-end="168">
<p data-start="118" data-end="168">Form <strong data-start="123" data-end="166">UI đẹp kiểu booking (gọn, card, shadow)</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="169" data-end="219">
<p data-start="171" data-end="219">Chọn <strong data-start="176" data-end="217">check-in / check-out → tự tính số đêm</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="220" data-end="309">
<p data-start="222" data-end="309"><strong data-start="222" data-end="307">Redirect sang chat <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Zalo</span></span> với tin nhắn đã điền sẵn</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="310" data-end="394">
<p data-start="312" data-end="394"><strong data-start="312" data-end="392">Gửi dữ liệu sang <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Google Sheets</span></span> (qua Apps Script API)</strong></p>
</li>
</ul>
<blockquote data-start="396" data-end="569">
<p data-start="398" data-end="416"><strong data-start="398" data-end="414">Bạn chỉ cần:</strong></p>
<ol data-start="419" data-end="569">
<li data-start="419" data-end="471">
<p data-start="422" data-end="471">Thay <code data-start="427" data-end="445">YOUR_ZALO_NUMBER</code> bằng số Zalo hoặc OA ID</p>
</li>
<li data-start="474" data-end="540">
<p data-start="477" data-end="540">Thay <code data-start="482" data-end="504">YOUR_APPS_SCRIPT_URL</code> bằng link Web App của Apps Script</p>
</li>
<li data-start="543" data-end="569">
<p data-start="546" data-end="569">Commit lại <code data-start="557" data-end="569">index.html</code></p>
</li>
</ol>
</blockquote>
