Link dạng:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="35" data-end="69"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>bdsducanh96-code.github.io</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="71" data-end="102">khi đặt trên bio TikTok rất dễ:</p>
<ul data-start="104" data-end="194">
<li data-start="104" data-end="135">
<p data-start="106" data-end="135">bị khách <strong data-start="115" data-end="135">nghi ngờ lừa đảo</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="136" data-end="175">
<p data-start="138" data-end="175">nhìn <strong data-start="143" data-end="175">không giống website homestay</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="176" data-end="194">
<p data-start="178" data-end="194">giảm tỉ lệ click</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start="196" data-end="316">Vì <strong data-start="199" data-end="270"><span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">GitHub</span></span> Pages chỉ là hosting miễn phí</strong>, nên domain mặc định luôn có chữ <code data-start="304" data-end="315">github.io</code>.</p>
<p data-start="318" data-end="357">Nhưng có <strong data-start="327" data-end="356">3 cách xử lý rất phổ biến</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="359" data-end="362">
<h1 data-start="364" data-end="403">Cách 1 (tốt nhất) – dùng domain riêng</h1>
<p data-start="405" data-end="420">Bạn mua domain:</p>
