<p data-start="1741" data-end="1797">💡 Tôi khuyên bạn cách này (rất rẻ nhưng chuyên nghiệp):</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1799" data-end="1875"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>mua domain 250k/năm</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>trỏ về GitHub Pages</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>dùng làm link bio TikTok</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1877" data-end="1955">Website vẫn chạy <strong data-start="1894" data-end="1918">miễn phí trên GitHub</strong> nhưng domain nhìn rất chuyên nghiệp.</p>
<hr data-start="1957" data-end="1960">
<p data-start="1962" data-end="1996">Nếu bạn muốn, tôi có thể chỉ luôn:</p>
<ul data-start="1998" data-end="2103">
<li data-start="1998" data-end="2026">
<p data-start="2000" data-end="2026"><strong data-start="2000" data-end="2026">cách mua domain 5 phút</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-start="2027" data-end="2077">
