<hr data-start="216" data-end="219">
<h1 data-start="221" data-end="270">1️⃣ Mở Apps Script từ Google Sheet (cách chuẩn)</h1>
<p data-start="272" data-end="307">Đừng mở link Apps Script trực tiếp.</p>
<p data-start="309" data-end="380">Hãy làm đúng đường này trong <strong data-start="338" data-end="379"><span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Google Sheets</span></span></strong>:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="382" data-end="429"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>Google Sheet</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Extensions</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Apps Script</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="431" data-end="478">Nó sẽ mở project script đúng với sheet của bạn.</p>
<hr data-start="480" data-end="483">
<h1 data-start="485" data-end="506">2️⃣ Thử tab ẩn danh</h1>
<p data-start="508" data-end="543">Nhiều trường hợp lỗi 400 do cookie.</p>
<p data-start="545" data-end="561">Cách nhanh nhất:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="563" data-end="641"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>Chrome</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Ctrl + Shift + N</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>mở Google Sheet</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>Extensions → Apps Script</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<hr data-start="643" data-end="646">
<h1 data-start="648" data-end="695">3️⃣ Kiểm tra đăng nhập nhiều tài khoản Google</h1>
<p data-start="697" data-end="727">Nếu bạn đăng nhập nhiều Gmail:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="729" data-end="766"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>Gmail cá nhân</span><br><span>Gmail công việc</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="768" data-end="792">Apps Script đôi khi lỗi.</p>
<p data-start="794" data-end="805">Cách xử lý:</p>
<ol data-start="807" data-end="872">
<li data-start="807" data-end="835">
<p data-start="810" data-end="835">đăng xuất bớt tài khoản</p>
</li>
<li data-start="836" data-end="856">
<p data-start="839" data-end="856">chỉ giữ 1 Gmail</p>
</li>
<li data-start="857" data-end="872">
<p data-start="860" data-end="872">mở lại Sheet</p>
</li>
</ol>
<hr data-start="874" data-end="877">
<h1 data-start="879" data-end="906">4️⃣ Xóa cache trình duyệt</h1>
<p data-start="908" data-end="921">Trong Chrome:</p>
