<h1 data-start="650" data-end="680">Giải pháp chuẩn (quan trọng)</h1>
<p data-start="682" data-end="728">Phải <strong data-start="687" data-end="727">đợi gửi dữ liệu xong rồi mới mở Zalo</strong>.</p>
<p data-start="730" data-end="760">Bạn sửa đoạn JS thành như sau:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="762" data-end="1194"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>JavaScript</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span class="ͼe">fetch</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼe">API_URL</span><span>,{</span><br><span>method:</span><span class="ͼc">"POST"</span><span>,</span><br><span>body:</span><span class="ͼe">JSON</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>stringify({</span><br><span>ten:</span><span class="ͼe">ten</span><span>,</span><br><span>checkin:</span><span class="ͼe">checkin</span><span>,</span><br><span>checkout:</span><span class="ͼe">checkout</span><span>,</span><br><span>khach:</span><span class="ͼe">khach</span><span>,</span><br><span>dem:</span><span class="ͼe">nights</span><br><span>})</span><br><span>})</span><br><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>then(</span><span class="ͼe">response</span><span> =&gt; </span><span class="ͼe">response</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>text())</span><br><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>then(</span><span class="ͼe">data</span><span> =&gt; {</span><br><br><span class="ͼ8">let</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">message</span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span class="ͼc">`Xin chào Homestay Hà Nội</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">Tên: </span><span>${</span><span class="ͼe">ten</span><span>}</span><br><span class="ͼc">Checkin: </span><span>${</span><span class="ͼe">checkin</span><span>}</span><br><span class="ͼc">Checkout: </span><span>${</span><span class="ͼe">checkout</span><span>}</span><br><span class="ͼc">Số khách: </span><span>${</span><span class="ͼe">khach</span><span>}</span><br><span class="ͼc">Số đêm: </span><span>${</span><span class="ͼe">nights</span><span>}</span><span class="ͼc">`</span><span>;</span><br><br><span class="ͼ8">let</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">url</span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span class="ͼc">"https://zalo.me/"</span><span class="ͼ8">+</span><span class="ͼe">zalo</span><span class="ͼ8">+</span><span class="ͼc">"?text="</span><span class="ͼ8">+</span><span class="ͼe">encodeURIComponent</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼe">message</span><span>);</span><br><br><span class="ͼe">window</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>location</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>href</span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span class="ͼe">url</span><span>;</span><br><br><span>});</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
