n-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)"><div tabindex="-1" class="[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn"><div class="flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow"><div data-message-author-role="assistant" data-message-id="8141615e-c489-4a4b-91df-2a4459b61c2b" dir="auto" data-message-model-slug="gpt-5-3" class="min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1"><div class="flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden"><div class="markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word light markdown-new-styling"><p data-start="0" data-end="64">Có 👍. Việc <strong data-start="12" data-end="48">mobile chờ lâu trước khi mở Zalo</strong> là do bạn đang:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="66" data-end="134"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>Submit form</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>chờ fetch gửi Google Sheet</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>mới redirect Zalo</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="136" data-end="243">Mạng 4G/5G đôi khi <strong data-start="155" data-end="215">fetch tới <span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Google Apps Script</span></span> mất 1–3s</strong>, nên người dùng thấy delay.</p>
<p data-start="245" data-end="296">Có 3 cách cải thiện. Tôi khuyên dùng <strong data-start="282" data-end="295">cách số 1</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="298" data-end="301">
<h1 data-start="303" data-end="349">✅ Cách tốt nhất: gửi dữ liệu nền (không chờ)</h1>
<p data-start="351" data-end="438">Ta <strong data-start="354" data-end="370">mở Zalo ngay</strong> rồi gửi dữ liệu nền sang <strong data-start="396" data-end="437"><span class="hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline"><span class="whitespace-normal">Google Sheets</span></span></strong>.</p>
<p data-start="440" data-end="458">Thay đoạn JS bằng:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="460" data-end="853"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>JavaScript</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span class="ͼe">fetch</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼe">API_URL</span><span>,{</span><br><span>method:</span><span class="ͼc">"POST"</span><span>,</span><br><span>mode:</span><span class="ͼc">"no-cors"</span><span>,</span><br><span>body:</span><span class="ͼe">JSON</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>stringify({</span><br><span>ten:</span><span class="ͼe">ten</span><span>,</span><br><span>checkin:</span><span class="ͼe">checkin</span><span>,</span><br><span>checkout:</span><span class="ͼe">checkout</span><span>,</span><br><span>khach:</span><span class="ͼe">khach</span><span>,</span><br><span>dem:</span><span class="ͼe">nights</span><br><span>})</span><br><span>});</span><br><br><span class="ͼ8">let</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">message</span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span class="ͼc">`Xin chào Homestay Hà Nội</span><br><br><span class="ͼc">Tên: </span><span>${</span><span class="ͼe">ten</span><span>}</span><br><span class="ͼc">Checkin: </span><span>${</span><span class="ͼe">checkin</span><span>}</span><br><span class="ͼc">Checkout: </span><span>${</span><span class="ͼe">checkout</span><span>}</span><br><span class="ͼc">Số khách: </span><span>${</span><span class="ͼe">khach</span><span>}</span><br><span class="ͼc">Số đêm: </span><span>${</span><span class="ͼe">nights</span><span>}</span><span class="ͼc">`</span><span>;</span><br><br><span class="ͼ8">let</span><span> </span><span class="ͼe">url</span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span class="ͼc">"https://zalo.me/"</span><span class="ͼ8">+</span><span class="ͼe">zalo</span><span class="ͼ8">+</span><span class="ͼc">"?text="</span><span class="ͼ8">+</span><span class="ͼe">encodeURIComponent</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼe">message</span><span>);</span><br><br><span class="ͼe">window</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>location</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>href</span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span class="ͼe">url</span><span>;</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<h3 data-start="855" data-end="866">Ưu điểm</h3>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="868" data-end="947"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>khách bấm nút</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>mở Zalo gần như ngay lập tức</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>dữ liệu vẫn gửi về sheet</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="949" data-end="986">UX mobile sẽ <strong data-start="962" data-end="985">nhanh hơn rất nhiều</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="988" data-end="991">
<h1 data-start="993" data-end="1016">🚀 Cách 2: delay 0.5s</h1>
<p data-start="1018" data-end="1059">Nếu bạn muốn chắc chắn dữ liệu vào sheet:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1061" data-end="1137"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="sticky z-2 select-none top-(--sticky-padding-top)"><div class="flex w-full items-center justify-between py-1.5 ps-4 pe-1.5 font-sans md:ps-5 bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary"><div class="flex max-w-[75%] min-w-0 cursor-default items-center text-sm font-medium justify-self-start text-token-text-primary"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-sm me-2.5 shrink-0"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#e45ab3" fill="currentColor"></use></svg>JavaScript</div><div class="flex flex-row items-center gap-0.5 justify-self-end"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-4 top-12 bottom-4"><div class="pointer-events-none sticky z-40 shrink-0 z-1!" style="top: calc(calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px) - 1px * 3); margin-bottom: calc(-4px); height: calc(4px); mask-image: linear-gradient(transparent 25%, white 75%);"><div class="sticky bg-token-border-light" style="top: calc(var(--sticky-padding-top) + 48px); height: 1px;"></div></div></div><div class="" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span class="ͼe">setTimeout</span><span>(</span><span class="ͼ8">function</span><span>(){</span><br><br><span class="ͼe">window</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>location</span><span class="ͼ8">.</span><span>href</span><span class="ͼ8">=</span><span class="ͼe">url</span><span>;</span><br><br><span>},</span><span class="ͼb">500</span><span>);</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1139" data-end="1176">Chỉ delay <strong data-start="1149" data-end="1157">0.5s</strong> nên vẫn khá nhanh.</p>
<hr data-start="1178" data-end="1181">
<h1 data-start="1183" data-end="1211">🚀 Cách 3: mở Zalo tab mới</h1>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1213" data-end="1237"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>window.open(url)</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1239" data-end="1307">Nhưng mobile đôi khi <strong data-start="1260" data-end="1274">chặn popup</strong>, nên tôi <strong data-start="1284" data-end="1306">không khuyến khích</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="1309" data-end="1312">
<h1 data-start="1314" data-end="1345">UX tốt nhất cho funnel TikTok</h1>
<p data-start="1347" data-end="1389">Flow chuẩn các hệ thống booking đang dùng:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="1391" data-end="1473"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-token-bg-elevated-secondary corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-fk4oovux.svg#ce3544" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼ5 ͼj"><div class="cm-scroller"><div class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly"><span>TikTok</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>link bio</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>form nhanh (5s)</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>mở Zalo ngay</span><br><span>↓</span><br><span>data lưu Google Sheet</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="1475" data-end="1516">Conversion cao nhất khi <strong data-start="1499" data-end="1515">Zalo mở &lt; 1s</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start="1518" data-end="1521">
<p data-start="1523" data-end="1603">💡 Nếu bạn muốn, tôi có thể gửi thêm <strong data-start="1560" data-end="1602">1 bản index.html tối ưu mobile hơn nữa</strong>:</p>
<ul data-start="1605" data-end="1752">
<li data-start="1605" data-end="1634">
<p data-start="1607" data-end="1634">UI giống <strong data-start="1616" data-end="1634">Airbnb booking</strong></p>
</li>
